{"id":"6afd57ef-bf7c-83ee-9662-ce9fd0e6a08d","sections":[{"count":4,"heading":"十、本章綜合習題","html":"<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">以下題目需要整合路易斯結構、電子域與鍵角觀念，比前面的理解檢查更有挑戰性。</p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">1. 比較 CO₂、SO₂ 與 H₂O 的分子形狀。哪些相同？哪些電子域排列不同？</p><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">顯示提示</span></button></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">2. 已知某分子中心原子有三個單鍵及一對孤電子對。判斷電子域排列、分子形狀，並解釋鍵角為何可能小於 109.5°。</p><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">顯示提示</span></button></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">3. 比較 CH₄、NH₃、H₂O 的鍵角大小，並說明為什麼三者雖然具有相同電子域數，鍵角卻不完全相同。</p><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">顯示提示</span></button></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">4. 某分子的中心原子有兩個雙鍵與一對孤電子對。預測它的電子域排列及分子形狀，並解釋為何不能把雙鍵各算成兩個電子域。</p><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">顯示提示</span></button></div></div></div>","messageId":"a1210257-deec-483b-9682-cecf2406c984","truncated":false}]}